  "details": "I am particularly talking about these ones:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/WSAM8PFptHM\n\nThese sound effects are still available when you are not logged into the game, and when you of course enter all the details to log into your account and press login. They're not entirely gone. (Assuming because of a mistake?)\n\nWe are aware that the game is not aiming to be \"futuristic\" anymore, but at least with an optional setting menu, the \"travelling to a different world\" sound effects would be really benefitial, to make it feel like we're going through a portal...\n\nThank you!",
